  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 6
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_00
    text: "Lucy. Lucy, don't\u2014 you don't have to do anything yet. You're not
      gonna know where you are, the room's gonna tip on you, that's normal, they
      changed your\u2014 no. Doesn't matter. I can't fix that part. We don't have
      long, either of us."
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 4.775
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_01
    text: I can't open it. Not from here, nobody can, not tonight. You can.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 6
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_02
    text: "When you're out there's an office, there's a printer, one sheet on it,
      you take it. The red on it, that's the wing they never finished, no cameras
      in there, I'll make sure it's empty. I can't walk you there, Lucy. You find
      it, you have to\u2014"
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
